# AI connections (an extension): Script > Allow AI Connections checks
# its item while a program may connect, and the configuration screen's
# "ask before an AI program's script runs" box sets whether the user is
# asked first. The command search finds the menu item too.
menu Script|Allow AI Connections
menus
twmove 217 202
twdown L 217 202
twup L 217 202
twmove 28 1300
twdown L 28 1300
twup L 28 1300
tw
twmove 28 1300
twdown L 28 1300
twup L 28 1300
tw
menu Script|Allow AI Connections
menus
key k ctrl
edit AI connections
menus
